 &nbsp; 
 
 🥃 The Supreme Court agreed to hear a challenge to the Reconstruction-era ban on distilling alcohol in private homes. Americans can legally brew beer or make wine at home, but making whiskey, vodka or other spirits can land them in federal prison. ( Axios )

 💻 Apple announced plans to reveal a new product at a launch event in Los Angeles on Oct. 28. Analysts expect a touch screen Mac laptop. ( CNBC )

 🧫 Biotech firms count on getting cash from licensing deals, but more of that cash is now being tied to hitting future milestones, says a JPMorgan-DealForma report reviewed exclusively by Axios Pro. ( Axios Pro ... Subscribe ) 

 
 
